    "updated_at": "2024-03-21T09:16:16Z",
    "body": "@whatwg/media We'd like to move this forward, as it's blocking the progress on the PiP spec. Should we prepare a PR based on @jernoble's recommendation? Although @marcoscaceres and I not sure that visibility is the right condition, as it also applies to Remote Playback, and there's still a way for the web app to pause playback.",
